# Cells cut by an interface take an area-weighted permittivity: usable, but the index scatters from grid to grid.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy.
title Silicon strip 450 x 220 nm on a 12.5 nm grid that cuts its walls, quasi-TM
grid dx=0.0125 dy=0.0125
window width=2.4 ymin=-0.8 ymax=1.0
rect si -0.225 0.225 0 0.22
symmetry even
field tm
expect neff 1.827296766 2e-8
expect group_index 3.741812361 2e-6
expect guided yes
expect cells 13824
